This is a copy of github.com/andybalholm/cascadia, used by the speedata
Publisher through the replace directive in src/go/go.mod.

Base: upstream master, commit 8dee753 ("Stop matching links with
:enabled"), after v1.3.5.

Changes:

- Support for :is() and :where() with forgiving selector lists
  (parser.go, pseudo_classes.go, serialize.go, is_test.go).

Only the source files are copied; the upstream tests, test resources
and fuzz data are left out. The working copy with the full history is
the fork https://github.com/speedata/cascadia (branch is-where). Make
changes there, run the tests, and copy the files over.
